    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Over 4000 bristles for precise brushing (63% higher than the average electric toothbrush)<br\/>✔ Integrated tongue brush for a complete clean<br\/>✔ Magnetic & rapid charging<br\/>✔ 3 cleaning modes to suit your daily routine<br\/>✔ Portable & durable — perfect for both home & travel, including a seamless travel case<br\/>✔ Helps lift visible buildup and surface stains<br\/>✔ 2-minute smart timer<br\/>✔ Advanced vibration technology — up to 36,000 pulses per minute<br\/>✔ Expert-developed design for trusted daily use<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the Air Electric Toothbrush",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>1. Preparation<\/strong>: Wet bristles, apply toothpaste.<\/p><p><strong>2.  Power On & Mode<\/strong>: Activate, select mode.<\/p><p><strong>3. Brushing<\/strong>: Place close, move slowly. Vibrates every 30 to alert.<\/p><p><strong>4. Auto Shutdown<\/strong>: Stops after 2 mins.<\/p><p><strong>5. Safe Removal<\/strong>: Turn off before taking out.<\/p><p><strong>6. Cleaning<\/strong>: Rinse, dry after use.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Air Electric Toothbrush consists of:<\/p><p>1x Air Premium Electric Toothbrush<\/p><p>1x Premium Gift Box<\/p><p>2x Additional Heads<\/p><p>1x Magnetic Charging Base<\/p><p>1x Manual<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>Not recommend to use by Children under the age of 9.<br\/><br\/>Only buy certified Electric Toothbrushes.<br\/><br\/>Please make sure to wash your mouth with warm water after use.<br\/><br\/>Includes 1 year manufacturer warranty.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cons of not using Air Electric Toothbrush",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Here is a list of cons of not using an Air Electric Toothbrush when compared to regular toothbrushes or other electric toothbrushes on the market:<\/strong><br\/><\/p><ul><li>Incomplete Cleaning: Manual brushing might miss hard-to-reach areas, leading to a less thorough clean.<br\/><\/li><li>Less Effective: Traditional brushes may not provide the same level of consistency and precision as Air.<br\/><\/li><li>Lack of Timer: Without timed pauses, brushing sessions might be uneven, risking inconsistent results.<br\/><\/li><li>Limited Features: Manual brushing lacks features like an integrated tongue brush and multiple cleaning modes.<br\/><\/li><li>Missed Benefits: Not using Air means missing out on advanced features and a more elevated brushing experience.<br\/><\/li><li>Less Convenience: Manual brushing lacks the travel-friendliness and effortless charging of Air.<br\/><\/li><li>Potential Discomfort: Improper technique could lead to brushing that's too harsh or ineffective over time.<br\/><\/li><li>Less Investment in Oral Care: Skipping Air means foregoing an advanced, long-lasting oral care tool.<br\/><\/li><li>Risk of Staining: Without Air's precision brushing, teeth may be more prone to surface stains.<br\/><\/li><li>Overall Oral Maintenance: Inconsistent brushing might impact the overall cleanliness and feel of your smile.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_iBYy4T": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Air Advanced Electric Toothbrush be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Air Advanced Electric Toothbrush is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. It has been designed to be gentle yet effective, ensuring thorough cleaning without causing damage to these dental materials. The advanced bristle technology and multiple brushing modes help maintain oral hygiene and remove plaque, providing a comprehensive clean even with these dental restorations.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
